direction: down
subject: "Library / Profile / Scenario\nNative subject, obligations and selected input identity"
sysml: "SysML projection / OpenSysML\nSelected requirements and assertions\nExplicit mapping and coverage"
quint: "Quint\nFinite transitions and safety\nNamed domains and bounds"
lean: "Lean\nConditional theorems and budget\nExplicit external premises"
rust: "Rust\nActual mechanism and observed traces\nCaptured source, lock and runtime"
mapping: "Method observation + correspondence\nInitial / transition / cut mapping\nRaw claims, strength, bounds and counters"
ascent: "ASCENT\nApplicable support / counter / pending\nDependency invalidation and scoped reuse"
review: "Aitia / Core\nReview disposition and current authority\nImported results cannot issue approval"
views: "D2 / Org\nShared IDs, design and evidence views\nNo independent verdict authority"
